	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Excellent, your Operation is fully setup on Mars, you are among the top 90 candidates for the Expert Explorer position! Now it is time for you to take a step back, literally. Mercury is your next destination. Due to planetary conditions caused by being so close to the Sun, you will want to make sure your power generation is in the best possible position before proceeding."
				""
				"*Your Premium Assessment includes 3 free Therapy sessions with our in-house physician. If you happen to overshot Mercury and fly straight into the simulated Sun, feel free to use them!"
			]
